:{"w":[{"name":"Favonius Greatsword","text":"ER and CRIT-triggered neutral particles help Sayu and the team sustain Burst rotations."},{"name":"Wolf's Gravestone","text":"High ATK boosts Burst healing."},{"name":"Skyward Pride","text":"High base ATK supports healing, while its ER substat helps maintain Burst uptime."},{"name":"Makhaira Aquamarine","text":"Its EM substat supports Swirls, while its passive converts EM into ATK for Sayu and nearby allies."},{"name":"Katsuragikiri Nagamasa","text":"Craftable Energy Recharge claymore with Skill damage and a delayed flat Energy refund, improving Burst consistency. Skill must hit to activate the passive. Refinements improve Energy refund."},{"name":"Sacrificial Greatsword","text":"Energy Recharge plus a chance to reset Skill cooldown grants another cast and extra particles. The cooldown reset triggers from Skill damage, notably the finishing kick; extra cast takes field time. Higher refinements improve reset reliability."},{"name":"Forest Regalia","text":"Craftable ER option; after triggering a Dendro-related reaction, creates a leaf that grants EM to its collector. Only in teams where Sayu can trigger the required Dendro reaction."},{"name":"Rainslasher","text":"Elemental Mastery improves Swirl and transformative reactions for rolling on-field builds. Prioritize ER first; passive is situational against Hydro/Electro-affected enemies."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Best overall: Swirl lowers the affected Pyro/Hydro/Cryo/Electro RES by 40% and improves Swirl damage.","stats":"ER/EM/ATK% · EM/ATK% · EM/Healing Bonus/ATK%"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants allies 20% ATK for 12s; use when no teammate carries Noblesse and Sayu can Burst reliably.","stats":"ER/ATK% · ATK% · Healing Bonus/ATK%"},{"names":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"text":"Converts healing into periodic physical damage; a niche option when Viridescent shred is already covered.","stats":"ER/ATK% · ATK% · Healing Bonus"}],"t":[{"name":"Roly-Poly Taser","members":["Sayu","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Fischl","Sucrose"],"text":"Sayu rolls with Hydro absorption to Swirl and drive reactions; Kokomi and Fischl apply elements while Sucrose groups and shares EM.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","Healer / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Battery","On-field Driver / EM Buffer"]},{"name":"Rolling Hyperbloom","members":["Sayu","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Sayu absorbs Hydro and spreads it during her roll; Nahida sustains Dendro, and full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom.","roles":["Driver / Healer","Hydro Applier","Dendro Support","Hyperbloom Trigger"]},{"name":"Sleepy Aggravate","members":["Sayu","Keqing","Fischl","Nahida"],"text":"Sayu heals and Swirls Electro to shred its RES; Nahida maintains Quicken for Keqing and Fischl Aggravates.","roles":["VV Healer","Electro Main DPS","Electro Sub DPS","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Firework Ninja","members":["Sayu","Lyney","Bennett","Xiangling"],"text":"Sayu offers healing and Pyro RES shred for Lyney; Bennett buffs and Xiangling adds off-field Pyro damage.","roles":["VV Healer","Pyro Main DPS","ATK Buffer","Pyro Sub DPS"]}],"v":"ATK Healing: Use ER/ATK% sands, ATK% goblet and Healing Bonus circlet; prioritize Burst uptime and healing before damage.\nC6 EM Healer: At C6, EM also increases Daruma healing; use EM main stats after meeting Burst Energy needs.\nOn-Field Roll Driver: Use high EM and Viridescent; quick rolls absorb an element and drive Swirl reactions. Level Sayu to 90.\nNoblesse Buffer: Choose 4pc Noblesse only when VV is covered and Sayu Bursts reliably; grants a teamwide ATK buff.\nBudget Energy: Favonius or craftable Katsuragikiri plus ER sands can make frequent Burst healing much easier.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Healer / Support"],"about":"Sayu is an Anemo healer who combines teamwide Burst healing with Viridescent Venerer RES shred. Her healing scales with ATK, while EM boosts Swirl damage and her active Swirl healing. Build enough Energy Recharge to Burst reliably; C6 makes EM-focused healing more effective.","pros":["Teamwide Burst healing","Viridescent RES shred","Flexible team support","Fun rolling reaction driver"],"cons":["High Burst energy demands","Limited crowd control","Rolling uses field time","EM healing improves at C6"],"weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Wolf's Gravestone","Skyward Pride","Makhaira Aquamarine","Katsuragikiri Nagamasa","Sacrificial Greatsword","Forest Regalia","Rainslasher"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge / ATK% / Elemental Mastery","ATK% / Elemental Mastery","Healing Bonus / Elemental Mastery / ATK%"],"stats":["ER off-field, every Burst: 200%+","ER off-field, alternate Burst: 150% - 170%","ER on-field driver: 160% - 180%","ER driver with C4: often 10% - 15% less","CRIT Rate with Favonius: 35% - 55%"],"vars":[{"title":"ATK-Focused Healer","role":"Healer","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Wolf's Gravestone","Katsuragikiri Nagamasa"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER/ATK% Sands, ATK% Goblet, Healing Bonus Circlet; ER first, then ATK%.","teams":"Works wherever healing plus Anemo utility is needed.","when":"Use before C6 if you need stronger direct Burst healing and do not prioritize personal Swirl damage.","cond":"Very high ER can be needed as solo Anemo.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"C6 EM Swirl Healer","role":"Healer / Swirl Support","weapons":["Makhaira Aquamarine","Rainslasher","Favonius Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build EM/EM/EM if Burst uptime permits; ER Sands if needed.","teams":"Teams that benefit from Swirl and can support her Energy needs.","when":"At C6, EM increases Daruma damage and healing while enhancing Swirl damage.","cond":"Requires Sayu C6.","notes":"C6 does not increase the initial teamwide Burst heal.","pre":false},{"title":"On-Field Rolling Driver","role":"On-field Driver","weapons":["Makhaira Aquamarine","Rainslasher","Katsuragikiri Nagamasa"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize EM and ER; Skill talent matters more than in off-field builds.","teams":"Use persistent off-field application; avoid reliance on Normal Attack-triggered effects.","when":"Roll to absorb an element, spread it, and trigger Swirls/reactions. Sayu Level 90 improves Swirl damage.","cond":"Requires substantial on-field time.","notes":"Rolling does not trigger Xingqiu/Yelan rain swords or Beidou Burst lightning.","pre":false},{"title":"Noblesse Team Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Greatsword","Katsuragikiri Nagamasa"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize ER and ATK% for consistent Bursts and strong healing.","teams":"Use only if another unit already supplies Viridescent shred or it is not needed.","when":"Give ATK-scaling carries a 20% team ATK buff while retaining healing.","cond":"Needs reliable Burst uptime; avoid duplicating Noblesse.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible ER Healer","role":"F2P Healer","weapons":["Katsuragikiri Nagamasa","Forest Regalia","Favonius Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER Sands; ATK% Goblet; Healing Bonus Circlet.","teams":"No premium weapon required; crafted sword materials may be needed.","when":"A budget path that prioritizes consistent Burst healing, then upgrades EM or ATK as Energy improves.","cond":"Forest Regalia passive needs Sayu to trigger a Dendro reaction.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Marionette Core","Teachings of Light","Guide to Light","Philosophies of Light","Whopperflower Nectar","Shimmering Nectar","Energy Nectar","Crystal Marrow","Gilded Scale","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Roly-Poly Taser","members":["Sayu","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Fischl","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Rolling Hyperbloom","members":["Sayu","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida","Kuki Shinobu"]},{"name":"Sleepy Aggravate","members":["Sayu","Keqing","Fischl","Nahida"]},{"name":"Firework Ninja","members":["Sayu","Lyney","Bennett","Xiangling"]}]}}],"title":"Sayu","el":"Anemo"}